{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Quant Operating Cockpit\n\n큰 글씨로 보는 팀별 운영 보드입니다.\n\n- 원본 판단: [[tasks/task_registry.csv|Task Registry]]\n- 팀/리드 기준: [[docs/ownership/team_charter.md|Team Charter]] / [[docs/ownership/module_ownership_map.md|Ownership Map]]\n- 작업 규칙: [[docs/operating_system/goal_operating_cycle.md|Goal Cycle]] / [[docs/report_standard.md|Report Standard]]","x":-1320,"y":-720,"width":650,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"how-to-use","type":"text","text":"# How To Use\n\n1. 팀 카드에서 owner 확인\n2. Current Lane에서 현재 작업 흐름 확인\n3. Blocker Gate에서 금지사항 확인\n4. Registry/Report에서 사실 검증\n\nCanvas는 지도입니다. 결정 원본은 registry/report/manifest입니다.","x":-1320,"y":-360,"width":650,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"codex-loop","type":"text","text":"# Codex Work Loop\n\n**Intake** 목표/팀/검증 정의\n\n**Navigate** board -> registry -> report\n\n**Edit** 최소 범위만 수정\n\n**Verify** task test + governance\n\n**Close** report/manifest/blocker 정리\n\n[[docs/obsidian/Codex Obsidian Workflow.md|Full Workflow]]","x":-1320,"y":70,"width":650,"height":430,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"blocker-gate","type":"text","text":"# Blocker Gate\n\n**blocked-source**\n소스 확보/감사 전까지 근사 금지\n\n**diagnostic-only**\n배포/자본 투입 주장 금지\n\n**runtime-source**\n운영 입력 가능, alpha 증명 아님\n\n**missing labels**\n절대 negative 처리 금지","x":-1320,"y":560,"width":650,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"team-regime","type":"text","text":"# 필수\n\n## Regime Research\n\n총괄 전략 방향, multi-day market/theme regime, theme universe, regime gate 품질.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask489 / Task567 / Task595\n\n**Review focus**\nforward-live computable regime, train/OOS separation","x":-560,"y":-720,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"team-intraday","type":"text","text":"# 성원\n\n## Intraday Continuation\n\nVWAP, entry-safe state, continuation archetype, false-positive decomposition.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask493 / Task557 / Task568 / Task581\n\n**Review focus**\nentry-safe factors, no label leakage","x":-80,"y":-720,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"team-chart","type":"text","text":"# 종찬\n\n## Strategy: Chart\n\nOHLC/VWAP entry context, indicator overlay, chart evidence contract.\n\n**Works with**\n규승 Frontend/UI\n\n**Review focus**\nchart evidence equals captured decision-time facts","x":400,"y":-720,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"team-data","type":"text","text":"# 윤헌\n\n## Data & Microstructure\n\nRaw/live source, KIS/Alpaca, NBBO, status/LULD, receive timestamp, freshness.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask495 / Task571 / Task590\n\n**Blockers**\nreceive timestamp / broker truth / full depth","x":880,"y":-720,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"team-backtest","type":"text","text":"# 동승\n\n## Backtest & Simulation\n\nDeterministic replay, walk-forward/OOS, cost/slippage, portfolio realism.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask505 / Task512 / Task553 / Task570\n\n**Review focus**\nreproducible metrics, exact lifecycle","x":-560,"y":-310,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"team-governance","type":"text","text":"# 중훈\n\n## Research Governance\n\nTask registry, report standard, artifact manifest, archive/migration rules.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask554 / Task591 / Task596\n\n**Review focus**\nno untracked decisions","x":-80,"y":-310,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"team-slack","type":"text","text":"# 서연\n\n## Slack Reporting\n\nTrade notification, EOD report, duplicate-send guard, supervisor alert.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask587 / Task589 / Task591\n\n**Rule**\nreporting success is not trade success","x":400,"y":-310,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"team-frontend","type":"text","text":"# 규승\n\n## Frontend/UI\n\nTrader Terminal, iPhone-first paper trading views, frontend catalog contract.\n\n**Current anchors**\nTask586 / Task594 / Task596\n\n**Rule**\nReact must not bypass catalog provenance","x":880,"y":-310,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"lane-runtime","type":"text","text":"# Current Runtime Lane\n\n## Task590 -> Task596\n\n**590** runtime market data source unification\n\n**591** institutional production hardening\n\n**592-593** workstation + mobile remote ops\n\n**594** investment app frontend overhaul\n\n**595-596** feedback plan + complete application\n\nThis lane improves operations and visibility. It does **not** promote strategy readiness by itself.","x":-560,"y":120,"width":680,"height":470,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"lane-research","type":"text","text":"# Research Backbone\n\n## Separate lanes stay separate\n\n**Regime**: Task489 / Task567\n\n**Intraday**: Task493 / Task568 / Task581\n\n**Microstructure**: Task495 / Task571 / Task580\n\n**Backtest**: Task512 / Task553 / Task570\n\nDo not collapse this into a single best-filter story.","x":200,"y":120,"width":620,"height":470,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"lane-live-blockers","type":"text","text":"# Live-Readiness Blockers\n\n## Hard gates\n\n- receive timestamp\n- broker truth fills\n- full depth provider\n- status/LULD continuity\n- exact order/fill lineage\n- cost/slippage realism\n\nUntil these are satisfied, strong diagnostics remain diagnostic.","x":880,"y":120,"width":420,"height":470,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"validation","type":"text","text":"# Validation Closeout\n\nRun governance checks after navigation/governance changes:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/task_registry_validate.py\npython scripts/codeowners_coverage_validate.py\npython scripts/governance_completion_audit.py\n```\n\nTask-specific commands come from [[tasks/task_registry.csv|registry]].","x":-560,"y":670,"width":680,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"discovery","type":"text","text":"# Discovery Aids\n\n[[graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md|Graphify Report]]\n\n[[docs/graphify/context_packs.json|Context Packs]]\n\nUse graph/backlinks to find context, then verify against source files.","x":200,"y":670,"width":620,"height":310,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"closeout","type":"text","text":"# Closeout Questions\n\n- 어떤 팀/리드가 owner인가?\n- report/manifest가 갱신됐나?\n- registry 변경이 필요한가?\n- 검증 명령이 통과했나?\n- 남은 blocker가 명시됐나?\n\n불명확하면 중훈 governance부터 확인.","x":880,"y":670,"width":420,"height":310,"color":"6"}
	],
